а) $\max(x; y) = \min(|x|; |y|)$; б) $\max(x; y) = \min(x^2; y^2)$;

в) $\max(x; y^2) = \min(y; x^2)$; г) $\max(|x|; y + 1) = \min(x^2; 2x + y)$.

pole:
